    <string name="ui_text_2a8241fc" formatted="false">当远程指针使用相对移动时，跳过加速、轴向锁定和惯性。</string>
    <string name="ui_text_e33a28c3" formatted="false">边缘滚动</string>
    <string name="ui_text_167cfe84" formatted="false">拖动至屏幕边缘时平移桌面。</string>
    <string name="ui_text_1c5988fd" formatted="false">自然滚动</string>
    <string name="ui_text_a96aedff" formatted="false">反转手势和鼠标滚轮的滚动方向。</string>
